@@ -16,9 +22,9 @@ An expression is a sum or difference of terms.

 ```gramaire
 Expr
-  : Expr '+' Term   {% \l _ r -> Add l r %}
-  | Expr '-' Term   {% \l _ r -> Sub l r %}
-  | Term            {% \t -> t %}
+  : Expr '+' Term   {% (c) => ({ tag: "Add", left: c.expr, right: c.term }) %}
+  | Expr '-' Term   {% (c) => ({ tag: "Sub", left: c.expr, right: c.term }) %}
+  | Term
 ```

