@@ -29,9 +35,9 @@ A term is a product or quotient of factors.

 ```gramaire
 Term
-  : Term '*' Factor {% \l _ r -> Mul l r %}
-  | Term '/' Factor {% \l _ r -> Div l r %}
-  | Factor          {% \f -> f %}
+  : Term '*' Factor {% (c) => ({ tag: "Mul", left: c.term, right: c.factor }) %}
+  | Term '/' Factor {% (c) => ({ tag: "Div", left: c.term, right: c.factor }) %}
+  | Factor
 ```

