@@ -42,8 +48,8 @@ A factor is a number or a parenthesised expression.

 ```gramaire
 Factor
-  : '(' Expr ')'    {% \_ e _ -> e %}
-  | NUMBER          {% \n -> Lit n %}
+  : '(' Expr ')'    {% (c) => c.expr %}
+  | NUMBER          {% (c) => ({ tag: "Lit", value: Number(c.number) }) %}
 ```

